WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.542
Module 11 builds on the SQL foundations developed so far.

00:00:04.542 --> 00:00:12.997
You now have experience with relational design, joins, subqueries, strings and dates, cleaning, and reshaping.

00:00:12.997 --> 00:00:22.042
Advanced SQL will combine those ideas into more powerful analytical patterns.

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:29.037
Carry forward the grain habit from this module, because advanced queries are only trustworthy when you know

00:00:29.037 --> 00:00:38.117
what each row represents. As you move forward, keep the reasoning habits from this module.

00:00:38.117 --> 00:00:46.667
The next topic will add new SQL tools, but it still depends on understanding grain, missing values,

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:50.000
and the meaning of each transformation.
